      {src: '/images/history/Screenshot_1-1-1024x413-1.jpg', altEn: 'WTIA Meet Our Member – Pixel Networks Limited (photo 2)', altZh: 'WTIA會員專訪－Pixel Networks Limited（相片 2）'}
